      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "This is my first solar system after several years of deliberation.The quotation was sent through promptly along with detailed information about the installation process and projected power savings etc.The install crew arrived promptly and carried out the work very professionally, keeping me informed of any power disruptions etc. The quality of the work was excellent and everything was left clean and tidy on completion. (Ascend also organised the meter replacement through Synergy and they happened to turn up on the same day, so that worked out perfectly).The system is working perfectly and the app is really useful for monitoring power data.",
