    {
      "review_id": "79854",
      "reviewer_name": "Russell",
      "reviewer_location": "WA - 6060",
      "reviewer_state": "WA",
      "reviewer_postcode": "6060",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2021-04-03",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Very pleased with the solar system from Ascend.The salesman was easy to relate to, friendly and funny. Made the effort to visit the site and give a live quote, showing the process in front of me.The actual install was swift, payment simple, and the quality of work was excellent - I haven't even found any broken tiles when they warned me it was all but guaranteed! The installers themselves were tidy, professional and communicated their needs and how the work would affect me at every stage. One of the installers took extra time to ensure the inverter monitoring was hooked up and working fully - even when my network was making it tough.Ascend provided a lot of assistance with applying to the retailer, and guided through the process of upgrading the meter and so on. For a first-timer, this was really helpful.About the only nitpick - and this is honestly scraping the barrel so hard I have splinters - is that the email correspondence was slow and not acknowledged, even if answers came in a call later.I did also ask for alternative panels, but was talked out of it. Later research suggested that the reasoning was misleading, but the system that was quoted and installed is highly satisfactory nonetheless.",
